{"page":{"id":"0d25a7ea-ecf8-4945-b8a8-b4f733908bbe","theme":"world-of-warcraft","slug":"/world-of-warcraft/azeroth/horde/orcs-of-azeroth","canonical_url":"https://www.tonolore.com/world-of-warcraft/azeroth/horde/orcs-of-azeroth","title":"Orcs","meta_title":"Orcs (Warcraft) — organization, lore & connections | Ton-o-Lore","meta_description":"Orcs came from Draenor through the Dark Portal, first as a demonic Horde and later as Thrall's redeemed people centered on Orgrimmar. Related pages: Horde,…","content":"<section class=\"intro\">\n    <p class=\"lead\">\n        Warrior people from <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/draenor\" class=\"entity-link\">Draenor</a> who settled <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/azeroth\" class=\"entity-link\">Azeroth</a>.\n    </p>\n\n    \n    <p>\n        Key threads from this canonical page lead to\n        <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/azeroth/horde\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Horde</strong></a>, <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/sargeras/burning-legion/guldan\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Gul&#039;dan</strong></a>, <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/azeroth/kalimdor\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Kalimdor</strong></a>, <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/draenor\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Draenor</strong></a>, <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/azeroth/kalimdor/orgrimmar\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Orgrimmar</strong></a> and <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/dark-portal\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Dark Portal</strong></a>.\n        Each link is another long-tail path through the subject.\n    </p>\n\n</section>\n\n\n\n\n\n<section class=\"connection-narrative\">\n    <h2>How Orcs connects</h2>\n    <p>\n        These mapped links are unique to this page — each one is another\n        long-tail route through the subject graph.\n    </p>\n    <ul>\n        \n        <li>\n            <strong>Member Of:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/azeroth/horde\" class=\"entity-link\">Horde</a>\n            — Orcs form the core of the <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/azeroth/horde\" class=\"entity-link\">Horde</a>.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Influenced By:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/sargeras/burning-legion/guldan\" class=\"entity-link\">Gul&#039;dan</a>\n            — <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/sargeras/burning-legion/guldan\" class=\"entity-link\">Gul&#039;dan</a> corrupted the orcs for the Legion.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/azeroth/kalimdor\" class=\"entity-link\">Kalimdor</a>\n            — <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/azeroth/kalimdor\" class=\"entity-link\">Kalimdor</a> is connected to Orcs through shared lore.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/draenor\" class=\"entity-link\">Draenor</a>\n            — <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/draenor\" class=\"entity-link\">Draenor</a> is connected to Orcs through shared lore.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/azeroth/kalimdor/orgrimmar\" class=\"entity-link\">Orgrimmar</a>\n            — <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/azeroth/kalimdor/orgrimmar\" class=\"entity-link\">Orgrimmar</a> is connected to Orcs through shared lore.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/dark-portal\" class=\"entity-link\">Dark Portal</a>\n            — Orcs is connected to <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/dark-portal\" class=\"entity-link\">Dark Portal</a> through shared lore.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/azeroth\" class=\"entity-link\">Azeroth</a>\n            — Orcs is connected to <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/azeroth\" class=\"entity-link\">Azeroth</a> through shared lore.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/azeroth/horde/thrall\" class=\"entity-link\">Thrall</a>\n            — Orcs is connected to <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/azeroth/horde/thrall\" class=\"entity-link\">Thrall</a> through shared lore.\n        </li>\n    </ul>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"graph-section\">\n    <h2>Mapped connections</h2>\n\n    <p class=\"section-intro\">\n        Every edge is another route through the subject. Expand a group\n        to see how these threads fit together.\n    </p>\n\n    \n<section class=\"topic-section\">\n    <details>\n        <summary class=\"topic-summary\">\n            <span class=\"topic-title\">Connected To</span>\n            <span class=\"topic-count\">7</span>\n        </summary>\n\n        \n        <div class=\"topic-examples\">\n            \n                <a\n                    href=\"/world-of-warcraft/azeroth/kalimdor\"\n                    class=\"connection\"\n                    data-relationship=\"Connected To\"\n                >\n                    <strong>Kalimdor</strong>\n                    <span>Western continent of orcs, night elves, and more.</span>\n                </a>\n            \n                <a\n                    href=\"/world-of-warcraft/draenor\"\n                    class=\"connection\"\n                    data-relationship=\"Connected To\"\n                >\n                    <strong>Draenor</strong>\n                    <span>Orcish homeworld later shattered into Outland.</span>\n                </a>\n            \n                <a\n                    href=\"/world-of-warcraft/azeroth/kalimdor/orgrimmar\"\n                    class=\"connection\"\n                    data-relationship=\"Connected To\"\n                >\n                    <strong>Orgrimmar</strong>\n                    <span>Capital city of the orcish Horde on Kalimdor.</span>\n                </a>\n            \n        </div>\n        \n\n        <div class=\"topic-content\">\n            \n 