?</h2>\n    \n    <p>\n        Orcs came from <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/draenor\" class=\"entity-link\">Draenor</a> through the <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/dark-portal\" class=\"entity-link\">Dark Portal</a>, first as a demonic <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/azeroth/horde\" class=\"entity-link\">Horde</a> and later as <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/azeroth/horde/thrall\" class=\"entity-link\">Thrall</a>&#039;s redeemed people centered on <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/azeroth/kalimdor/orgrimmar\" class=\"entity-link\">Orgrimmar</a>.\n    </p>\n    \n    <p class=\"also-known-as\">\n        <strong>Also known as:</strong>\n        Orcish Horde.\n    </p>\n\n</section>","word_count":401,"uniqueness_score":"0.6500"},"entity":{"id":"00106bd1-58fa-4c2b-8974-0b0484d8d269","name":"Orcs","slug":"orcs-of-azeroth","type":"organization","short_description":"Warrior people from Draenor who settled Azeroth.","description":"Orcs came from Draenor through the Dark Portal, first as a demonic Horde and later as Thrall's redeemed people centered on Orgrimmar.","evidence":"fiction","universe":"world-of-warcraft","aliases":["Orcs","Orcish Horde"],"wikipedia_url":null,"image_url":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/3/31/Orc_Horde_Kodo_Animated_Gif.gif/revision/latest?cb=20060518010119","image_source":"https://wowpedia.fandom.com/wiki/Orc","image_credit":"Fair-use identification thumbnail via Fandom. Character / franchise art © Blizzard Entertainment (as applicable). Not free or redistributable artwork.","image_license":"fair_use","image_usage":"fair_use_identification","image_alt":"Identification thumbnail for Orcs"},"connections":[{"id":"5215248b-51c8-427f-af57-282f1c80aeb7","relationship":"member_of","title":"Orcs form the core of the Horde.","explanation":null,"strength":"0.9700","discovery_score":"0.9400","direction":"outgoing","from_entity_id":"00106bd1-58fa-4c2b-8974-0b0484d8d269","to_entity_id":"3b004081-0ac1-4ae1-ae94-865075960d89","entity_id":"3b004081-0ac1-4ae1-ae